WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 27]

01:44.539 --> 01:47.180
Everyone in the Immortal Palace thinks they're the best.

01:47.180 --> 01:48.979
They keep saying things about the Immortal and the three worlds.

01:48.979 --> 01:50.660
But they are just all talk.

01:51.060 --> 01:52.780
They can't give up their obsession

01:52.780 --> 01:54.580
just like me.

01:55.100 --> 01:56.539
What a joke.

01:56.700 --> 01:58.360
That's none of your business.

02:15.100 --> 02:15.940
Immortal...

02:37.780 --> 02:38.710
Xiyin Mountain.

02:43.460 --> 02:44.920
Xiyin Mountain is stable.

02:45.860 --> 02:47.060
Did Luo Ge...

02:50.420 --> 02:51.579
Yes.

02:54.300 --> 02:55.420
He did it.

02:57.660 --> 02:58.540
Luo Ge.

02:58.980 --> 03:00.260
Just wait.

03:01.060 --> 03:03.420
We'll meet again.

03:16.460 --> 03:17.340
Ao Yin

03:17.980 --> 03:20.840
will never cause trouble to the mortal world again.

03:23.380 --> 03:23.940
Liu Shao.

03:24.900 --> 03:25.700
Luo Ge is here.

03:26.380 --> 03:27.010
Liu Shao.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.910
But he can't recognize me anymore.

03:36.460 --> 03:37.020
Liu Shao.

03:37.700 --> 03:38.230
Liu Shao.

03:57.300 --> 03:57.860
Luo Ge.

04:03.060 --> 04:03.780
Demon King,

04:05.140 --> 04:05.780
thank you.

04:06.500 --> 04:08.260
If you really want to thank me,

04:09.100 --> 04:10.630
please forgive my brother.

04:13.500 --> 04:15.100
If you want me to forgive him,

04:16.380 --> 04:18.459
ask him to send my sister back first.

05:34.370 --> 05:36.140
Useless!

05:36.900 --> 05:39.850
You can't even stand one attack from Luo Ge!

05:43.659 --> 05:45.720
Luo Ge has become the Immortal again.

05:46.020 --> 05:47.900
Ao Yin is just a demon.

05:48.500 --> 05:49.380
Now,

05:50.540 --> 05:52.540
do you think you can beat him?

05:53.540 --> 05:54.260
Shut up!

05:54.260 --> 05:55.380
Luo Ge

05:55.610 --> 05:56.740
and Lu Li

05:56.900 --> 05:58.380
are just the same as me.

06:00.450 --> 06:01.380
What do you want?

06:03.300 --> 06:05.030
You still own one magic weapon.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.740
The one you took

06:06.940 --> 06:09.400
from the Yin-yang Cave a thousand years ago.

06:18.420 --> 06:18.950
Brother.

06:29.500 --> 06:30.220
Fu.

06:30.540 --> 06:31.700
Judging from the sky,

06:31.700 --> 06:33.900
I think my brother must have succeeded.

06:35.620 --> 06:37.620
The paper boats you released

06:38.100 --> 06:39.760
to pray for him are not in vain.

06:40.340 --> 06:41.300
Thank you, too.

06:41.580 --> 06:43.580
Thank you for accompanying me and comforting me these days.

06:43.580 --> 06:45.780
You took me to many interesting places.

07:32.620 --> 07:33.860
Luo Ge.

07:42.340 --> 07:43.140
Are you awake?

07:46.140 --> 07:47.470
Are you feeling better?

07:48.340 --> 07:49.870
Are you the mortal Luo Ge

07:51.100 --> 07:52.540
or the Immortal Luo Ge?

07:53.020 --> 07:53.980
They are both me.

07:56.180 --> 07:57.020
Is it true?

07:58.580 --> 08:00.380
The Immortal Luo Ge?

08:16.380 --> 08:18.820
Did your magic power really recover?

08:30.020 --> 08:30.550
Liu Shao.

08:32.380 --> 08:34.640
For the past few days in the mortal world,

08:35.179 --> 08:37.620
I wanted to give up all my responsibilities willfully

08:37.620 --> 08:39.480
and make you bear all these for me.

08:39.780 --> 08:41.640
I put you in a difficult position.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.820
Do you remember everything?

08:45.380 --> 08:47.540
No matter how many times of tribulations I've experienced,

08:47.540 --> 08:49.340
I shouldn't have forgotten you.

08:51.090 --> 08:52.740
Since you remember everything,

08:52.740 --> 08:54.470
will the Soul-devouring Spell

08:54.860 --> 08:56.020
attack again?

08:58.340 --> 09:00.600
The Soul-devouring Spell born from love

09:00.820 --> 09:03.300
and the Phoenix Tears that make people forget love

09:03.300 --> 09:04.900
actually oppose each other.

09:05.620 --> 09:07.220
They kept fighting in my body

09:07.620 --> 09:08.530
until

09:09.100 --> 09:10.830
they completely disappeared.

09:10.940 --> 09:11.580
Really?

09:16.220 --> 09:17.900
But what if...

09:18.860 --> 09:19.890
Don't worry.

09:20.730 --> 09:21.790
But if you can't...

09:22.260 --> 09:23.100
I know.

09:24.420 --> 09:26.280
I know what you're worried about.

09:26.660 --> 09:27.220
And I know

09:28.220 --> 09:30.350
you're ready to leave Xiyin Mountain.

09:30.820 --> 09:32.950
There are pros and cons to everything.

09:33.060 --> 09:34.060
If I set limits for everything,

09:33.270 --> 09:37.820
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

09:35.140 --> 09:37.200
what's the use of being the Immortal?

09:39.930 --> 09:44.670
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

09:45.190 --> 09:51.250
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

09:45.780 --> 09:46.540
Keep this.

09:47.260 --> 09:48.720
Don't throw it away again.

09:49.340 --> 09:51.100
Just like the Soul-devouring Spell

09:51.100 --> 09:52.240
and the Phoenix Tears,

09:52.240 --> 09:58.230
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

09:53.660 --> 09:55.820
everything in the world is intertwined.

09:55.820 --> 09:57.660
But there will always be a solution.

09:57.660 --> 09:59.690
What I am fighting with is the evil of the three worlds.

09:59.690 --> 10:04.530
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

10:01.140 --> 10:02.220
I want a reason

10:02.380 --> 10:03.700
to persist.

10:05.380 --> 10:06.860
I want to give you a future.

10:06.100 --> 10:11.220
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

10:07.780 --> 10:08.710
I want to fulfill

10:08.940 --> 10:10.220
one of your wishes.

10:11.510 --> 10:17.570
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

10:13.860 --> 10:15.340
Immortal Luo Ge.

10:17.420 --> 10:18.180
Can I...

10:17.980 --> 10:24.720
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

10:18.580 --> 10:20.220
kiss you?

10:24.740 --> 10:27.790
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

10:27.950 --> 10:30.740
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

10:31.330 --> 10:33.880
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

10:33.880 --> 10:37.470
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

10:37.210 --> 10:38.940
You said Lu Li is you.

10:37.820 --> 10:40.420
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

10:38.940 --> 10:40.620
Then I can kiss you if I want.

10:40.420 --> 10:44.850
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

10:44.850 --> 10:51.440
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

10:52.320 --> 10:56.350
[May every day be just like today. May we be together forever and never abandon each other.]

10:59.460 --> 11:02.340
Other people release wishing lanterns to pray to the Immortal Palace.

11:02.340 --> 11:04.330
Now the Immortal is right beside you.

11:04.330 --> 11:05.660
Who are you praying to?

11:06.300 --> 11:07.860
You used to say

11:07.860 --> 11:09.570
I'm one of all beings.

11:10.010 --> 11:11.580
So I'll do the same thing.

11:11.890 --> 11:14.100
You may take it as

11:11.940 --> 11:16.780
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

11:14.100 --> 11:16.300
listening to the prayers of all beings.

11:18.350 --> 11:23.460
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

11:23.760 --> 11:29.820
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

11:30.230 --> 11:38.720
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

11:40.240 --> 11:43.290
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

11:43.460 --> 11:46.240
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

11:46.840 --> 11:49.380
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

11:49.380 --> 11:52.970
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

11:53.330 --> 11:55.920
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

11:55.500 --> 11:56.980
Dear Immortal,

11:55.920 --> 12:00.350
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

11:57.220 --> 12:00.060
may my son have a smooth life.

12:00.350 --> 12:06.450
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

12:00.650 --> 12:01.220
Granted.

12:01.740 --> 12:02.870
Merciful Immortal,

12:03.140 --> 12:05.820
please bless me to spend the rest of my life with my husband.

12:05.820 --> 12:06.460
Granted.

12:06.700 --> 12:09.890
♫I'm willing to spread my wings♫

12:06.820 --> 12:08.010
Dear Immortal,

12:08.380 --> 12:09.580
please let my mother

12:09.890 --> 12:12.750
♫And don't fight the fate♫

12:10.020 --> 12:11.460
recover from her disease.

12:11.460 --> 12:12.060
Granted.

12:13.100 --> 12:13.740
Immortal,

12:13.120 --> 12:22.690
♫It's a good moment to share the world with you♫

12:14.220 --> 12:15.570
I want to see the world.

12:15.900 --> 12:16.500
Granted.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.260
Immortal,

12:20.260 --> 12:22.420
do you want to hear my wish?

12:25.580 --> 12:26.900
May every day

12:27.130 --> 12:28.260
be just like today.

12:28.860 --> 12:30.320
May we be together forever

12:30.740 --> 12:31.820
and never be apart.

12:34.860 --> 12:35.460
Granted.

12:40.100 --> 12:41.010
Every day

12:41.580 --> 12:42.910
will be just like today.

12:43.740 --> 12:45.060
We'll be together forever

12:45.060 --> 12:46.660
and never abandon each other.

12:46.660 --> 12:47.420
I

12:48.100 --> 12:48.630
granted.

12:49.140 --> 12:50.050
You promise

12:51.300 --> 12:53.230
and will never go back on your word?

12:53.260 --> 12:54.250
I promise

12:55.220 --> 12:57.080
and I will never go back on my word.

13:18.180 --> 13:19.620
Now what I want

13:20.380 --> 13:21.460
is in my arms.

13:22.500 --> 13:23.760
For the rest of my life,

13:24.340 --> 13:26.900
I only wish to protect the peace of the three worlds

13:26.900 --> 13:28.540
and the safety of all beings.

13:34.340 --> 13:35.260
Today,

13:36.340 --> 13:38.470
I heard the sorrow and joy of all beings

13:38.860 --> 13:40.860
and understood the righteousness.

13:41.980 --> 13:43.260
I'm here to pray,

13:44.890 --> 13:46.540
from now on,

13:47.500 --> 13:49.360
I'm willing to take the happiness

13:49.980 --> 13:51.980
and the worries of the world as mine.

13:52.540 --> 13:53.900
Suffer with the world

13:55.300 --> 13:57.430
and enjoy the happiness with the world

13:58.940 --> 14:00.670
until the whole world is united

14:02.220 --> 14:03.860
and there is no more sorrow.

14:06.170 --> 14:09.560
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

14:10.280 --> 14:15.760
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

14:16.360 --> 14:21.250
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

14:21.510 --> 14:26.720
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

14:24.540 --> 14:25.540
Immortal Master,

14:25.940 --> 14:27.900
thousand of stars suddenly appeared.

14:27.900 --> 14:31.490
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

14:28.980 --> 14:30.110
What does that mean?

14:31.620 --> 14:33.210
If I'm right,

14:31.990 --> 14:37.560
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

14:33.460 --> 14:35.260
Luo Ge has seen through his heart

14:35.700 --> 14:37.160
and the rules of the world,

14:37.460 --> 14:39.940
and preliminarily shown signs of becoming a god.

14:38.160 --> 14:43.380
♫When will we separate?♫

14:41.420 --> 14:42.340
Will Luo Ge soon

14:43.260 --> 14:45.100
be promoted to Supreme God?

14:43.620 --> 14:51.380
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

14:51.380 --> 14:52.860
Welcome Immortal

14:53.180 --> 14:54.780
return from the tribulation.

14:54.780 --> 14:56.770
I fell into the mortal world accidentally.

14:56.770 --> 14:58.570
Sorry for making you concerned.

14:58.650 --> 15:01.180
It's good that you returned safely.

15:01.660 --> 15:04.300
The crisis of the three worlds has been solved.

15:04.300 --> 15:05.700
The only worrying thing

15:06.380 --> 15:08.040
is the Four Seasons Monument.

15:14.580 --> 15:15.550
Don't worry.

15:15.890 --> 15:17.420
I'll make some preparation

15:17.540 --> 15:19.000
to reinforce magic circle

15:19.420 --> 15:21.420
and stabilize the Four Seasons Monument.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.150
That's good.

15:27.860 --> 15:29.120
Where is Shang Yurong?

15:31.700 --> 15:32.900
-I’m not going. -Come with me.

15:32.900 --> 15:34.420
I'm not going, Senior.

15:34.780 --> 15:36.380
You know what I did.

15:36.620 --> 15:38.380
Luo Ge will skin me.

15:38.380 --> 15:39.040
How dare he!

15:39.140 --> 15:40.380
If he dares to skin you,

15:40.380 --> 15:42.220
I'll tear down the Chonghua Palace.

15:42.220 --> 15:44.750
He may, at most, peel off your trendy clothes.

15:44.940 --> 15:45.740
No way.

15:45.900 --> 15:48.140
What's the difference between skinning me?

15:48.140 --> 15:49.540
Liu Shao is fine now.

15:49.700 --> 15:51.380
You may plead later.

15:51.380 --> 15:52.450
I dare not.

15:52.900 --> 15:53.780
Just tell Luo Ge

15:54.100 --> 15:55.100
I'm in seclusion.

15:56.740 --> 15:57.780
When I succeed,

15:58.530 --> 15:59.650
I will master...

15:59.880 --> 16:00.830
Burning Sea?

16:01.500 --> 16:02.830
Great Sword Formation.

16:06.140 --> 16:07.380
Are you really going to the demon world?

16:07.380 --> 16:09.580
The Four Seasons Monument is too important.

16:09.580 --> 16:11.300
You have to take care of here first.

16:11.300 --> 16:13.020
But can you be relieved

16:13.020 --> 16:14.680
if Luo Ning doesn't come back?

16:16.900 --> 16:17.860
I do worry a lot.

16:19.500 --> 16:20.900
I had no memory back then.

16:21.380 --> 16:22.420
Otherwise, I wouldn't have let Luo Ning

16:22.420 --> 16:23.420
leave with Fu.

16:23.820 --> 16:24.780
Fu

16:26.130 --> 16:27.130
is too dangerous.

16:29.620 --> 16:31.500
But Fu is also He Na's brother.

16:32.300 --> 16:34.780
There won't be any danger for me to meet He Na.

16:40.540 --> 16:41.010
Fu.

16:41.210 --> 16:42.010
What's wrong?

16:44.900 --> 16:47.700
Your brother has returned to the Immortal Palace.

16:48.220 --> 16:49.550
Are you going back soon?

16:54.780 --> 16:55.550
You said

16:56.940 --> 16:59.270
you want to visit the place where I grew up.

16:59.620 --> 17:00.300
Okay.

17:00.660 --> 17:01.300
How about

17:01.620 --> 17:02.260
tomorrow?

17:02.650 --> 17:03.740
We'll go tomorrow.

17:03.740 --> 17:04.460
And then?

17:04.859 --> 17:07.589
Leave me again and return to the Immortal Palace?

17:09.020 --> 17:09.859
Fu...

17:10.140 --> 17:10.660
What?

17:12.700 --> 17:13.760
Even you dislike me

17:14.380 --> 17:16.109
because I'm an aquatic monster

17:16.260 --> 17:18.460
that will die without water, don't you?

17:18.740 --> 17:19.940
You're not a monster.

17:20.579 --> 17:21.260
Although

17:21.569 --> 17:23.140
you are not a good person,

17:23.740 --> 17:25.599
you're definitely not a monster.

17:39.010 --> 17:40.540
So this is the Demon Palace.

17:40.540 --> 17:42.500
Don't you have walls in your rooms?

17:43.460 --> 17:44.460
This is my room.

17:49.980 --> 17:51.020
Your room

17:51.220 --> 17:52.250
is only as big as

17:52.420 --> 17:53.460
the palm.

17:55.140 --> 17:56.740
I don't like being controlled

17:56.740 --> 17:57.500
so I usually

17:57.820 --> 17:59.300
stay alone.

18:00.220 --> 18:00.620
Why?

18:01.220 --> 18:02.220
You don't like it?

18:02.330 --> 18:04.140
If you don't like it, I'll change to a bigger one tomorrow.

18:04.140 --> 18:05.020
No need.

18:05.540 --> 18:07.200
I don't like big rooms either.

18:07.380 --> 18:08.840
It's common to feel lonely

18:08.980 --> 18:10.440
if you keep staying alone.

18:12.260 --> 18:13.860
You won't be lonely anymore.

18:14.180 --> 18:15.510
I'll always be with you.

18:16.260 --> 18:16.700
Look.

18:17.180 --> 18:18.240
If this crystal cup

18:18.540 --> 18:20.260
is used to serve my dew,

18:20.460 --> 18:21.660
it must be beautiful.

18:25.450 --> 18:25.940
Look.

18:27.100 --> 18:28.100
They are in pairs.

18:28.420 --> 18:29.020
Tomorrow,

18:29.180 --> 18:30.660
one for you and one for me.

18:31.220 --> 18:32.380
Let's collect the dew together.

18:32.380 --> 18:33.380
What do you think?

18:42.180 --> 18:42.580
Fu.

18:47.380 --> 18:48.040
Demon King.

18:50.020 --> 18:50.880
Fairy Luo Ning.

18:51.380 --> 18:52.460
Liu Shao's waiting for you outside.

18:52.460 --> 18:53.390
Liu Shao's here?

18:54.900 --> 18:55.820
Liu Shao.

18:56.260 --> 18:56.740
Luo Ning.

18:56.740 --> 18:57.300
-Liu Shao. -Luo Ning.

18:57.300 --> 18:57.700
Fu.

19:00.420 --> 19:02.020
Liu Shao is here for Luo Ning.

19:05.380 --> 19:05.810
What?

19:07.540 --> 19:09.340
You think I caused trouble again

19:09.780 --> 19:11.560
since I brought the fairy back.

19:13.100 --> 19:13.620
Cool.

19:14.340 --> 19:16.940
Tie me up and apologize to the Immortal Palace.

19:20.730 --> 19:22.980
I risked my life to subdue the demon world

19:22.980 --> 19:24.340
for your freedom.

19:24.930 --> 19:27.930
Do you think I'll send you back to the Immortal Palace?

19:33.970 --> 19:34.900
How's your hand?

19:42.060 --> 19:44.690
What happened between you and Fu?

19:47.410 --> 19:48.020
Then

19:48.840 --> 19:51.040
what happened between you and brother?

19:53.180 --> 19:55.220
You're an immortal and he's a demon.

19:55.810 --> 19:58.940
The love between immortals and demons is unacceptable.

20:00.140 --> 20:01.260
But everyone says

20:02.130 --> 20:04.500
you and my brother's spiritual power oppose each other

20:04.500 --> 20:05.560
and can't coexist.

20:06.180 --> 20:07.420
But you still

20:07.860 --> 20:09.180
insist to be together

20:09.820 --> 20:10.900
no matter live

20:11.380 --> 20:12.580
or dead.

20:14.660 --> 20:15.140
Right.

20:44.220 --> 20:45.340
I always think

20:45.340 --> 20:47.380
there is a bond between me and the Brahma tree.

20:47.380 --> 20:49.560
Now it seems that it likes you more.

20:57.660 --> 20:58.540
Why

21:00.780 --> 21:02.700
I feel familiar with this tree?

21:03.220 --> 21:04.300
I feel like

21:04.900 --> 21:06.200
I've seen it before.

21:27.340 --> 21:28.420
And the flowers.

21:30.300 --> 21:31.220
I don't know why

21:32.860 --> 21:34.790
I really want to cry when I see them.

21:48.180 --> 21:51.180
Have you heard of the legend of the Brahma tree?

21:52.700 --> 21:55.760
The tragic ending of the Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui

21:55.940 --> 21:59.270
is not only because of the gap between immortals and demons.

21:59.300 --> 22:00.360
More importantly,

22:00.660 --> 22:02.660
their love began with deception.

22:03.620 --> 22:04.150
Luo Ning,

22:04.700 --> 22:06.430
your brother doesn't trust Fu.

22:07.540 --> 22:09.180
But if you want to choose him,

22:09.780 --> 22:11.220
why don't you feel

22:11.660 --> 22:13.020
if he is sincere to you.

22:15.060 --> 22:16.020
If he is,

22:16.780 --> 22:18.460
I'll persuade your brother for you.

22:18.460 --> 22:19.570
Sincere...

22:20.340 --> 22:21.020
I think

22:21.620 --> 22:23.860
he is sincere to me.

22:41.980 --> 22:42.500
Luo Ge.

22:42.780 --> 22:43.820
I found Luo Ning.

22:44.980 --> 22:46.700
She wants to play for a few more days.

22:46.700 --> 22:47.500
I want to

22:47.780 --> 22:50.240
stay with her in the Demon Palace for a while.

22:54.780 --> 22:56.580
I'm busy at the Immortal Palace.

22:56.620 --> 22:58.660
I might not be able to take care of you.

22:58.660 --> 23:00.390
You can play for a few more days.

23:08.780 --> 23:11.780
Luo Ge, you're a liar who values love over friendship.

23:12.930 --> 23:15.020
You even tricked me here

23:15.020 --> 23:15.980
to revenge for Liu Shao.

23:15.980 --> 23:17.840
Can you behave like the Immortal?

23:17.940 --> 23:19.180
You've been torturing me for so long.

23:19.180 --> 23:20.220
What's the matter?

23:20.220 --> 23:21.140
If there's nothing, I'm leaving.

23:21.140 --> 23:21.570
Wait.

23:29.740 --> 23:31.270
What else do you want to say?

23:31.340 --> 23:31.740
Say it.

23:35.810 --> 23:38.060
I'm actually a little worried about Luo Ning.

23:38.060 --> 23:39.410
The General of Water

23:39.410 --> 23:40.380
disobeyed his brother

23:40.380 --> 23:42.100
to accompany Luo Ning.

23:42.980 --> 23:44.940
I think Luo Ning is quite like him.

23:47.100 --> 23:48.620
Did you overstep it?

23:50.380 --> 23:51.460
You do know

23:52.820 --> 23:54.550
about Immortal Ze Shui's past.

24:01.140 --> 24:01.870
How dare you!

24:02.180 --> 24:02.700
Fu.

24:04.580 --> 24:05.440
What happened?

24:05.690 --> 24:06.140
Leave.

24:09.180 --> 24:09.710
Nothing.

24:10.330 --> 24:11.380
It's just that the crystal cup you like

24:11.380 --> 24:11.980
is broken.

24:12.580 --> 24:14.500
But I know which craftsman made it.

24:14.500 --> 24:15.370
I can definitely find

24:15.370 --> 24:16.500
the same one for you.

24:17.100 --> 24:17.820
It's okay.

24:18.420 --> 24:19.860
The fragrance I made

24:19.860 --> 24:22.460
is much more precious than these crystal cups.

24:22.820 --> 24:23.940
I just made it.

24:23.940 --> 24:24.740
Try it for me.

24:25.660 --> 24:25.990
Here.

24:31.330 --> 24:33.130
Don't let your brother see this.

24:33.460 --> 24:34.580
So what?

24:35.980 --> 24:38.180
Will my brother forbid me to like girls?

24:49.410 --> 24:49.860
Fu.

24:50.850 --> 24:51.780
Come out with me.

24:58.220 --> 24:58.880
Wait for me.

25:08.900 --> 25:09.760
I didn't expect

25:10.060 --> 25:11.660
the tracing fragrance

25:11.980 --> 25:13.380
has come in handy so soon.

25:14.980 --> 25:16.500
And I can know

25:17.370 --> 25:19.100
if Fu did something wrong again

25:19.340 --> 25:21.620
that made Demon King look so bad.

25:38.460 --> 25:38.860
Fu.

25:40.020 --> 25:40.620
How are you

25:41.580 --> 25:42.640
and Luo Ning doing?

25:49.860 --> 25:51.260
She's mine now.

25:52.700 --> 25:53.100
You...

26:01.580 --> 26:02.100
Fu.

26:02.820 --> 26:03.780
I will announce

26:03.780 --> 26:05.540
that I'll pass the position of Demon King to you the other day.

26:05.540 --> 26:08.940
And then you'd go to the Immortal Palace to propose marriage.

26:12.500 --> 26:13.980
If brother disagrees,

26:14.500 --> 26:16.160
I'll take Liu Shao away with me

26:16.340 --> 26:17.200
to piss him off.

26:19.420 --> 26:20.350
What did you say?

26:20.500 --> 26:22.860
The Immortal Palace never accepts the marriage with the Demons.

26:22.860 --> 26:24.790
But if you propose as the Demon King

26:24.940 --> 26:26.540
and Luo Ning is willing to marry you,

26:26.540 --> 26:27.660
it may work out.

26:29.740 --> 26:30.270
Brother.

26:31.460 --> 26:34.120
But I don't want your position as the Demon King.

26:35.420 --> 26:36.680
I want to give it to you.

26:36.810 --> 26:37.670
I don't want it.

26:38.050 --> 26:39.420
You worked so hard to get it.

26:39.420 --> 26:41.020
You even lost one hand for it.

26:41.940 --> 26:42.800
I don't want it.

26:43.740 --> 26:45.670
Do you still want to marry Luo Ning?

26:46.620 --> 26:47.140
No.

26:49.020 --> 26:51.220
The Immortal Palace always looks down on us.

26:51.220 --> 26:52.220
Immortal Ze Shui

26:52.420 --> 26:53.340
is the source

26:53.340 --> 26:54.740
of our clan's suffering.

26:54.900 --> 26:55.980
I hate them so much.

26:57.460 --> 26:58.120
And Luo Ning

26:58.420 --> 26:59.460
is important to Luo Ge

26:59.460 --> 27:00.820
and the Immortal Palace.

27:00.820 --> 27:02.940
She's also the inheritor of Immortal Ze Shui.

27:02.940 --> 27:03.500
So,

27:04.380 --> 27:06.840
she's the perfect choice to take revenge on.

27:10.500 --> 27:11.140
Fu,

27:12.530 --> 27:14.330
Fairy Luo Ning is sincere to you.

27:14.460 --> 27:16.190
How can you treat her like this?

27:18.820 --> 27:20.900
It's her choice to throw herself at me.

27:20.900 --> 27:22.260
Do you want me to

27:24.290 --> 27:26.540
lose the girl who threw herself at me like you?

27:26.540 --> 27:26.940
You...

27:40.860 --> 27:42.460
If you really think so,

27:42.860 --> 27:43.900
I can only ask Liu Shao

27:43.900 --> 27:45.660
to take Luo Ning back to Immortal Palace now.

27:45.660 --> 27:46.590
She won't leave.

27:48.100 --> 27:48.660
Besides,

27:49.220 --> 27:50.680
as long as I treat her well,

27:52.660 --> 27:54.420
she will depend more on me.

27:59.300 --> 28:00.260
You're afraid.

28:01.540 --> 28:03.140
You're afraid she'll leave.

28:21.540 --> 28:22.140
Luo Ning?

28:24.180 --> 28:24.980
What's wrong?

28:28.060 --> 28:28.740
Nothing.

28:29.450 --> 28:30.620
I just recalled

28:30.900 --> 28:32.260
what you said before.

28:35.180 --> 28:35.860
Liu Shao.

28:37.650 --> 28:38.620
Tell me.

28:39.740 --> 28:40.460
If

28:41.000 --> 28:42.850
there are many lies in love,

28:43.740 --> 28:45.100
is that still love?

28:47.090 --> 28:48.450
Did Fu lie to you?

28:51.060 --> 28:51.820
No.

28:52.140 --> 28:53.860
If he dares to lie to me,

28:53.860 --> 28:55.320
I won't let him off easily.

29:02.140 --> 29:03.260
Help me!

29:04.300 --> 29:05.460
Help me!

29:05.460 --> 29:06.460
Help me out!

29:06.460 --> 29:08.540
Help me out!

29:19.140 --> 29:19.890
Immortal Master.

29:19.890 --> 29:20.420
Ge.

29:20.580 --> 29:21.580
You are still here

29:21.780 --> 29:22.760
even it's late.

29:23.940 --> 29:24.540
Maybe

29:24.680 --> 29:25.900
it's because I'm old.

29:26.060 --> 29:28.140
Since you returned from the mortal world,

29:28.140 --> 29:30.760
I've been worried about the Four Seasons Monument.

29:30.760 --> 29:31.390
So,

29:31.400 --> 29:33.020
I come here often.

29:33.130 --> 29:33.730
Why did you

29:33.790 --> 29:35.340
come here?

29:35.540 --> 29:36.420
I just felt

29:36.690 --> 29:38.620
there's an abnormal wave near the Four Seasons Monument.

29:38.620 --> 29:39.350
I was worried

29:40.100 --> 29:41.360
so I came to have a look.

29:41.700 --> 29:42.420
The Protection Spell

29:42.420 --> 29:43.950
of Immortal Palace is solid

29:44.050 --> 29:45.300
and you are guarding here.

29:45.300 --> 29:45.900
I think

29:45.930 --> 29:47.330
everything will be fine.

29:48.380 --> 29:51.110
But the Four Seasons Monument is still unstable.

29:51.260 --> 29:52.320
I'm still worried.

29:53.780 --> 29:54.740
As for this,

29:55.700 --> 29:57.090
the major reason

29:57.420 --> 29:59.550
may be that Liu Shao's spiritual power

29:59.740 --> 30:01.660
opposes yours.

30:02.100 --> 30:03.300
Don't worry about it.

30:03.620 --> 30:04.550
I know what to do.

30:05.820 --> 30:06.620
That's good.

30:08.410 --> 30:08.940
Let's go.

30:31.620 --> 30:32.780
You've been worried

30:33.420 --> 30:34.940
since you came here.

30:35.580 --> 30:37.640
My spiritual power opposes Luo Ge's.

30:39.630 --> 30:41.820
As long as this problem is not solved,

30:42.300 --> 30:44.030
I won't be able to rest assured.

30:44.540 --> 30:44.940
Here.

30:46.380 --> 30:47.140
This is...

30:47.660 --> 30:49.390
The Six-star Brilliant Array.

30:50.450 --> 30:51.220
It can seal

30:51.660 --> 30:52.940
your Sun Spirit

30:52.510 --> 30:56.040
[Six-star Brilliant Array]

30:53.860 --> 30:56.300
so that you and Luo Ge won't oppose each other anymore.

30:56.300 --> 30:57.610
But this formation

30:58.540 --> 30:59.860
is very dangerous.

31:01.170 --> 31:02.700
It may damage the meridians

31:03.260 --> 31:04.990
and kill the person on the spot.

31:05.260 --> 31:06.540
You must be careful.

31:09.220 --> 31:11.080
There really is such a formation.

31:11.820 --> 31:14.820
It was created by the Demon King ten thousand years ago

31:14.860 --> 31:17.260
to keep Immortal Ze Shui.

31:17.740 --> 31:19.940
It's very harmful to the sealed person.

31:20.290 --> 31:22.500
In order to keep Immortal Ze Shui,

31:23.220 --> 31:25.220
the Demon King even risked her life.

31:26.500 --> 31:28.960
The Demon King dared to seal Immortal Ze Shui

31:29.180 --> 31:30.940
because he got a magic weapon

31:31.580 --> 31:33.500
that could prevent Immortal Ze Shui's meridians

31:33.500 --> 31:34.630
from being damaged.

31:35.780 --> 31:36.580
What is it?

31:37.060 --> 31:38.460
Tears of the Half-Demon.

33:01.100 --> 33:02.420
It's Bai Feng's scent.

33:03.500 --> 33:04.820
She is still alive?

33:13.260 --> 33:14.060
Why?

33:14.660 --> 33:16.060
Why I can't see anything?

33:19.820 --> 33:20.550
Who's there?

33:21.620 --> 33:22.300
Who?

33:22.540 --> 33:23.300
Who?

33:26.980 --> 33:27.820
Fu.

33:28.540 --> 33:29.820
You saved me.

33:30.980 --> 33:32.180
What's wrong with me?

33:32.540 --> 33:33.900
Why I can't see anthing?

33:35.180 --> 33:36.310
Don't you remember?

33:36.690 --> 33:38.260
Your eyes were hurt by

33:38.380 --> 33:40.180
by Zhuo Qiuxian's Thunder Whip.

33:40.180 --> 33:40.980
You are blind.

33:56.500 --> 33:57.700
It was all your fault.

33:57.900 --> 33:59.340
It was all because you instigated me.

33:59.340 --> 34:00.580
It was all your fault.

34:00.620 --> 34:01.540
It was all your fault.

34:01.540 --> 34:02.540
I instigated you?

34:02.760 --> 34:04.420
That was your true intention.

34:04.740 --> 34:06.400
But the one who really hurt you

34:06.710 --> 34:08.239
and pushed you off the cliff

34:08.600 --> 34:09.820
was Liu Shao.

34:10.530 --> 34:12.210
If I hadn't saved you,

34:12.929 --> 34:15.860
you would have been executed by the Immortal Palace.

34:29.060 --> 34:31.070
They will not expect that

34:32.540 --> 34:34.260
I sealed you

34:35.060 --> 34:36.659
and hid you in front of them.

34:40.940 --> 34:41.570
Save me?

34:43.840 --> 34:46.100
You are afraid that I'll be caught by them

34:46.570 --> 34:48.830
and reveal what you've done, aren't you?

34:50.010 --> 34:50.520
Well.

34:51.230 --> 34:52.560
You are not that stupid.

34:54.550 --> 34:55.389
Fu,

34:56.020 --> 34:58.200
it turned out that you've been lying to me.

34:58.200 --> 35:00.060
I like dealing with smart people.

35:00.180 --> 35:01.100
So I can

35:01.270 --> 35:02.490
cure your eyes.

35:03.490 --> 35:05.150
But you have to prove to me that

35:05.170 --> 35:05.930
keeping you

35:06.350 --> 35:07.210
is useful to me.

35:08.370 --> 35:09.370
How can I prove it?

35:16.600 --> 35:17.820
Luo Ge and Liu Shao

35:17.900 --> 35:20.760
are now together openly.

35:23.020 --> 35:24.580
Do you hate them?

35:31.000 --> 35:31.970
If the hatred

35:32.140 --> 35:33.570
is unforgettable,

35:33.990 --> 35:35.390
then you are useful to me.

35:42.010 --> 35:44.950
This is the medicine made by Mr. Tai, a skilled doctor of our clan.

35:44.950 --> 35:46.460
If you keep using it for ten days,

35:46.460 --> 35:47.920
your eyes will get better.

35:52.300 --> 35:53.810
I'll come to you then.

36:10.230 --> 36:10.990
So

36:12.080 --> 36:13.380
you've been using me.

36:14.980 --> 36:16.710
You said you will take care of me

36:17.120 --> 36:18.120
and care about me.

36:18.760 --> 36:20.160
Are all those words fake?

36:21.360 --> 36:22.200
Or...

36:23.540 --> 36:25.270
that’s part of your plan.

36:48.200 --> 36:49.040
Bai Feng,

36:50.460 --> 36:52.720
although you have done many evil things,

36:53.570 --> 36:55.500
I don't want to stain my hands.

37:00.250 --> 37:00.850
Medicine!

37:00.880 --> 37:01.610
My medicine!

37:01.680 --> 37:02.410
Give it back!

37:02.560 --> 37:03.690
Give it back!

37:04.450 --> 37:05.000
Who?

37:05.630 --> 37:06.380
Who is there?

37:07.470 --> 37:08.650
Give it back!

37:09.280 --> 37:10.160
My medicine!

37:13.060 --> 37:13.690
Who?

37:25.910 --> 37:27.630
You deserve this.

37:38.340 --> 37:39.430
Take care.

37:49.260 --> 37:51.660
The seal of the Four Seasons Monument still exists.

37:51.660 --> 37:54.190
How did he activate my Soul-devouring Spell?

37:54.260 --> 37:56.660
How did he release the son of the Demon King?

37:57.070 --> 37:58.290
Something is fishy.

38:03.880 --> 38:04.760
This is...

38:43.610 --> 38:44.530
Luo Ge.

38:45.330 --> 38:47.530
I didn't expect to see you again so soon.

38:48.020 --> 38:49.360
You're so relaxed.

38:50.160 --> 38:51.500
But I'm curious

38:52.090 --> 38:54.230
how did you escape from the Four Seasons Monument.

38:54.230 --> 38:56.460
I was born from obsession.

38:56.670 --> 38:58.140
I can go wherever I want.

38:58.270 --> 38:59.730
There's no need to escape.

39:00.370 --> 39:00.790
No.

39:01.840 --> 39:04.020
It's impossible for ordinary evil spirit to be that powerful.

39:04.020 --> 39:04.440
Yes.

39:04.940 --> 39:05.780
Good.

39:06.370 --> 39:08.680
Think hard here.

39:09.690 --> 39:13.220
You'll eventually become another me anyway.

39:16.870 --> 39:17.930
If this continues,

39:18.260 --> 39:19.660
something might happen.

39:20.230 --> 39:21.360
Looks like I need to find a way

39:21.360 --> 39:24.360
to repair the Four Seasons Monument soon as possible.

39:27.960 --> 39:29.010
Brahma tree,

39:29.890 --> 39:31.950
is this the feeling of being deceived

39:32.120 --> 39:32.870
and betrayed

39:33.630 --> 39:34.890
by the one I love?

39:36.230 --> 39:37.160
It is

39:37.700 --> 39:38.500
painful.

39:40.140 --> 39:41.570
Ten thousand years ago,

39:42.450 --> 39:44.930
did Immortal Ze Shui feel the same as me?

39:45.850 --> 39:46.440
Luo Ning.

39:46.610 --> 39:47.140
Luo Ning.

39:47.320 --> 39:47.870
Look.

39:48.080 --> 39:50.940
I found a whole set of crystal cups and crystal pots.

39:51.180 --> 39:53.180
You can store as much dew as you want.

39:54.210 --> 39:54.750
No need.

39:56.690 --> 39:57.690
You don't like it?

39:57.820 --> 39:58.240
Yes.

39:59.160 --> 40:00.020
I don't like it.

40:00.470 --> 40:01.220
So, no need.

40:04.370 --> 40:04.900
Luo Ning.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.240
What's wrong?

40:10.250 --> 40:11.130
Nothing.

40:12.060 --> 40:13.480
I just told Liu Shao

40:14.580 --> 40:15.160
that

40:15.460 --> 40:17.640
I'll go back to the Immortal Palace with her today.

40:17.640 --> 40:18.570
What did you say?

40:21.380 --> 40:23.310
You said you'd stay a few more days.

40:23.480 --> 40:25.280
But I don't want to stay anymore.

40:28.060 --> 40:29.860
Did Liu Shao tell you something?

40:30.180 --> 40:30.830
No.

40:32.510 --> 40:34.190
I suddenly figured it out.

40:36.750 --> 40:37.590
Maybe

40:38.680 --> 40:39.880
immortals and demons

40:40.070 --> 40:41.500
shouldn't be together.

40:42.460 --> 40:44.990
The tragedy of Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui

40:45.530 --> 40:47.290
is our best lesson.

40:48.720 --> 40:49.730
Now that

40:50.150 --> 40:51.950
you have regained your freedom,

40:52.080 --> 40:54.010
you should stay in the Demon Palace

40:54.100 --> 40:55.430
as the General of Water.

40:55.990 --> 40:57.880
I'm going back to the Immortal Palace

40:57.880 --> 40:59.470
as Fairy Luo Ning.

41:00.650 --> 41:01.320
From now on,

41:01.910 --> 41:03.240
we'll live our own lives

41:03.300 --> 41:04.500
and never meet again.

41:05.180 --> 41:05.900
Isn't that better?
